*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*&      Form  GT_WINDER
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*       text
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
*      -->ZCHARG     text
*      -->ZPLNBEZ    text
*      -->ZDESC      text
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
FORM GT_WINDER USING ZCHARG ZPLNBEZ CHANGING ZDESC.
  DATA :ZZCHARG TYPE STRING.

  CLEAR : DNAME, DLENG.
  REFRESH : ZLINE.
  MOVE ZCHARG TO ZZCHARG.
  CONDENSE ZZCHARG.
  DLENG = 22 - STRLEN( ZPLNBEZ ).
  SHIFT ZZCHARG BY DLENG PLACES RIGHT.
  CONCATENATE ZPLNBEZ ZZCHARG INTO DNAME.

  IF DNAME IS NOT INITIAL.
    CALL FUNCTION 'READ_TEXT'
      EXPORTING
        ID              = 'VERM'
        LANGUAGE        = 'E'
*       INLINE_COUNT    = 1
        NAME            = DNAME
        OBJECT          = 'CHARGE'
      TABLES
        LINES           = ZLINE
      EXCEPTIONS
        ID              = 1
        LANGUAGE        = 2
        NAME            = 3
        NOT_FOUND       = 4
        OBJECT          = 5
        REFERENCE_CHECK = 6
        OTHERS          = 99.

    READ TABLE ZLINE INDEX 1.
    IF SY-SUBRC = 0.
      ZDESC = ZLINE-TDLINE.
    ELSE.
      ZDESC = ''.
    ENDIF.
  ELSE.
    ZDESC = ''.
  ENDIF.
ENDFORM.                    "GT_WINDER

