FORM CONVROLLKG USING ZMAT ZBATCH ZWERKS ZCHAR CHANGING ZATWTB.
  DATA : PATWTB TYPE P DECIMALS 3.

  PERFORM VBGETDET USING ZMAT ZBATCH ZWERKS ZCHAR CHANGING ZATWTB.
  REPLACE ALL OCCURRENCES OF 'Kg/Rol' IN ZATWTB WITH ''.
  SHIFT ZATWTB RIGHT DELETING TRAILING SPACE.
  SHIFT ZATWTB LEFT DELETING LEADING SPACE.
  REPLACE ALL OCCURRENCES OF ',' IN ZATWTB WITH ''.
  MOVE ZATWTB TO PATWTB.
  MOVE PATWTB TO ZATWTB.
ENDFORM.                    "CONVROLLKG

