*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*       text
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
*      -->ZMAT       text
*      -->ZPLANT     text
*      -->ZSLOC      text
*      -->ZQTY       text
*      -->ZGBLOC     text
*      -->ZCHARG     text
