FORM VBGETDET2 USING ZMATNR ZCHARG ZWERKS ZATNAM ZATNAM1 ZATNAM2 CHANGING ZATWTB ZATWTB1 ZATWTB2. " add for new company
  CLEAR : ZCLBATCH. REFRESH : ZCLBATCH.
